# Code owners for MGM.
#
# Changes to the paths below need approval from a code owner other than the
# person who pushed the change, on the final head commit. This is a maintainer
# social contract: the merger verifies it before merging, and GitHub does not
# block a merge that lacks it (enforcement is deferred; see #30 and
# docs/operating-model.md § "Merge controls"). Other paths are intentionally
# unlisted: the author may merge them once the required checks pass.
#
# Verify a path still exists before relying on a line here; a pattern that
# matches nothing protects nothing and GitHub does not warn about it;
# src/lib/__tests__/codeowners.test.ts checks that each pattern matches a
# tracked file. If a file below is moved, update this file in the same change.

